{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L1doZXJlJTIwRG9lcyUyMEElMjBCb2R5JTIwRW5kJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Where Does A Body End","description":"From their roots as a brutal, confrontational industrial band, through breakups and chaos, to their odds-defying current status as one of the most accomplished and ambitious bands in the world, one whose concerts are more like ecstatic rituals than nostalgic trips. SWANS has always been a collection of singular performers, but there's been one constant since its formation in 1982--singer, songwriter Michael Gira. 'Where Does a Body End?' is a SWANS documentary with unfettered access to hundreds of hours of Gira/SWANS archives of never-seen-before recordings, videos, and photographs. An unfiltered story of a life in the arts, frequent difficulty spanning decades without a safety net, creating work because Gira says \"What else am I going to do?\"\n\nReleased 19 Sept 2019 · Canada · Language: English · 161 min\nStudio: Eyelight Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Documentary","Music","Hollywood"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1dqXCynVLkOWaZZ8R17bSuQuXwf.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mQkIBJEMbjjpmafJadI6ibabPpN.jpg","imdbRating":"7.9","imdb_id":"tt8954326","moviedb_id":593720,"tmdbId":593720,"runtime":"161 min","cast":["Michael Gira","Jarboe","Thurston Moore","Lee Ranaldo","Amanda Palmer","Devendra Banhart","Blixa Bargeld","J.G. Thirlwell"],"director":["Marco Porsia"],"released":"2019-09-19T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"\"Michael is not a fearless person, but he is a fearless artist.\"","country":"Canada","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Marco Porsia","character":"Director"},{"name":"Michael Gira","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/diJjwPvJEJR1CK63z2Qjwn5asdR.jpg"},{"name":"Jarboe","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/llhcuX4SB69kjWMr